# Git commits

- **Format**: Use [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/): `type(scope): subject` (e.g. `fix(auth-service): handle expired token`).
- **Size**: One logical change per commit when possible; easier review and safer reverts.
- **History**: Prefer rebase or squash over unnecessary merge commits to keep history readable.
- **Message body**: Add a short explanation when the subject alone isn’t enough.
- **Before push**: Ensure lint and tests pass per project standards.
